player: I've arrived to the new job, the place is kinda creepy.
player: The ad was a little odd, they didn't even interview me. But I think I can trust them.
player: I hope this would be easy and i could gome early.
boss: Hello! I'm so happy you are here, a new member of the family!
boss: We need to deliver the food to our customers. Please, press the blue button to receive the order, then place the objects on the box and press the red button to send it.